# Advitya Healthcares — host redirect rules
#
# The brief asks that the site be published under the official
# advityahealthcares.com domain rather than a hosting subdomain. The DNS and
# the host's custom-domain setting are the other half of that change; this
# file is the part that lives in the repository.
#
# Read by Netlify and by Cloudflare Pages. Other static hosts ignore it
# harmlessly, so it is safe to keep here whichever host the site ends up on.

# ---- canonical host -------------------------------------------------------
# Anything served from a hosting subdomain is sent to the official domain,
# path intact, with a permanent redirect so search engines transfer the
# ranking rather than indexing two copies of the site.
https://:project.netlify.app/*        https://advityahealthcares.com/:splat   301!
https://:project.pages.dev/*          https://advityahealthcares.com/:splat   301!

# www to the bare domain, matching every canonical tag in the HTML.
https://www.advityahealthcares.com/*  https://advityahealthcares.com/:splat   301!

# ---- clean URLs -----------------------------------------------------------
# The brief suggests advityahealthcares.com/advitya-hospital-baruipur. The
# page itself is a .html file like every other page on the site, so the clean
# path is served from it rather than redirected to it — the address bar keeps
# the short form.
/advitya-hospital-baruipur            /advitya-hospital-baruipur.html         200
/advitya-healthcares                  /advitya-healthcares.html               200
/departments                          /departments.html                       200
/doctors                              /doctors.html                           200
/opd-schedule                         /opd-schedule.html                      200
/centres-of-excellence                /centres-of-excellence.html             200
/our-network                          /our-network.html                       200
/patient-services                     /patient-services.html                  200
/contact                              /contact.html                           200
